Source: ${PRODUCT_NAME}
Maintainer: Arm HPC Software <support-hpc-sw@arm.com>
Section: default
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.2.1

Package: ${PRODUCT_NAME}
Architecture: arm64
Description: A C/C++/Fortran compiler for AArch64 Linux systems based on LLVM
 Arm Toolchain for Linux is an C/C++/Fortran toolchain based on the LLVM compiler suite. It has been prepared specifically for the AArch64 GNU/Linux systems.
Homepage: https://github.com/arm/arm-toolchain
Section: default
Priority: optional
Provides: atfl
Depends: binutils, libstdc++-11-dev, arm-performance-libraries
